  instructionText: 'LO2.4 - Promoting the domain created the forward lookup zone
    automatically, but not the reverse one, which is what lets a technician resolve
    an IP address back to a name.


    In DNS Manager > Reverse Lookup Zones > New
    Zone > IPv4, type the Network ID.'
